{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549430/extras/history.png?t=1741172997\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549430/extras/walk5.gif?t=1741172997\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An ordinary worker goes on a business trip. Since the organization is experiencing financial difficulties, they rented him a house on the outskirts of the city. We are tired, driving to this house at night and don\u2019t even suspect that otherworldly evil is waiting for us in the house, ready to devour us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549430/extras/Puzzle.png?t=1741172997\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549430/extras/22.gif?t=1741172997\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On your way you will encounter many challenging and unique puzzles, solve them to move further towards your goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549430/extras/Atmosphere.png?t=1741172997\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549430/extras/4.gif?t=1741172997\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for intense first-person horror where every step could be your last and every turn could lead to new, nightmarish discoveries.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549430?t=1741172997","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549430?t=1741172997","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549430/2528516d41397744090a4f1a7f8